  "id": "future-orientation",
  "term": "future orientation",
  "definition": "Future orientation is a person’s focus on and preparation for what lies ahead, such as future work, education, and life beyond a current role. In this context, it refers to how adolescents think about, plan for, and feel concerned or prepared about their future.",
